{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Second plan review returned BLOCK on a valid index-catalog premise. `code-review-docs` is a `code-review-pass` overlay, so `reviewers/index.json` excludes it by design. Removed index regeneration from the plan, file impact, verification commands, and acceptance criteria. Added the protected-content exclusion as an explicit rubric deliverable. Split the remaining compound verification criterion into focused tests, offline eval validation, lint, and type checking."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787681039941815001,"uuid":"d1bfd803-02b9-41c8-b1c3-f471be4bbb35"}